## Acceptance Criteria
- [ ] `refresh-earnings --tickers_file ... --budget 20` fetches at most 20
      tickers, caches JSON, skips already-fresh entries
- [ ] Surprise math: (0.55 actual, 0.40 est) → +37.5%; est 0.01 → floored
      denominator (hand-pinned)
- [ ] Signal is +1 from report+1 through report+hold_days inclusive, HOLD
      outside; confidence increases with surprise size
- [ ] ADV below min_adv → HOLD even at +100% surprise
- [ ] Existing strategies byte-identical after the attrs change
- [ ] No network in tests; strategies read cache only
- [ ] Tests pass: `uv run pytest tests/ -m "not exercise"`

## Edge Cases and Error Handling
| Situation | Expected behaviour |
|-----------|-------------------|
| No cached earnings for a ticker | HOLD + one logged notice (not per-bar spam) |
| estimatedEPS null (AV gaps) | That quarter skipped — no surprise computable |
| Two reports inside one hold window | Newer report resets the window/confidence |
| Backtest window predates cache coverage | Those dates simply produce HOLD — backtest still runs, coverage noted in output |
| AV rate-limit response mid-refresh | Stop the run, keep partial cache, report how many remain |

